# 01 搜索请求生命周期 - 第 12 章
sequenceDiagram
  participant App
  participant Coord
  participant Shard1
  participant Shard2
  participant Shard3
  App->>Coord: POST /idx/_search
  Coord->>Coord: parse + rewrite
  Coord->>Shard1: search request
  Coord->>Shard2: search request
  Coord->>Shard3: search request
  Shard1-->>Coord: top 10 (local)
  Shard2-->>Coord: top 10 (local)
  Shard3-->>Coord: top 10 (local)
  Coord->>Coord: merge + sort + pagination
  Coord-->>App: final hits
```

```mermaid
# 02 Master 选举 - 第 12 章
sequenceDiagram
  participant N1
  participant N2
  participant N3
  Note over N1,N3: N1 当前 master 失联
  N2->>N3: preVote
  N3-->>N2: ok
  N2->>N2: bump term, become candidate
  N2->>N3: vote request
  N3-->>N2: granted
  N2-->>N1,N3: elected as master
```

```mermaid
# 03 Reindex 双写切换 - 第 22 章
flowchart LR
  A[V1 alias write] -->|reindex| B[V2 build]
  B -->|add alias read-only| C{Dual write?}
  C -->|No, just reindex| D[Stop V1 write<br/>Switch alias]
  C -->|Yes, zero-downtime| E[Keep V1 write<br/>Dual write V2]
  E -->|backfill done| F[Switch alias write to V2]
  F -->|stability check| G[Drop V1]
```

```mermaid
# 04 慢查询 profile 流水线 - 第 7、9、10 章
flowchart LR
  Q[Query DSL] --> R[Rewrite]
  R --> B[Build scorers]
  B --> M[Match docs]
  M --> S[Score / highlight / sort]
  S --> F[Fetch _source]
  F --> RES[Result]

  Q -. profile .-> P[Profile Tree<br/>query / rewrite / score / fetch]
  P --> RES
```

```mermaid
# 05 CCR 数据流 - 第 13 章
flowchart LR
  subgraph Leader[Leader Cluster]
    L1[Primary shard]
    L2[Translog]
  end
  subgraph Follower[Follower Cluster]
    F1[Follower shard]
    F2[Remote buffer]
  end
  L1 -> L2 ->|ship| F2 -> F1
  F1 -. lag .-> L1
```

```mermaid
# 06 Vector + BM25 混合 (RRF) - 第 19 章
flowchart LR
  Q[Query] --> BM[BM25 match]
  Q --> KV[KNN search]
  BM --> RRF[RRF rank]
  KV --> RRF
  RRF --> Top[Top K]
  Top --> OptionalRerank[Cross-Encoder Rerank]
  OptionalRerank --> Final[Final Result]
```
